WEBVTT

00:05.964 --> 00:09.175
[opening theme music playing]

00:36.453 --> 00:38.204
[Do-hwa breathing shakily]

00:40.707 --> 00:42.667
[midwife] Please, my Lady,
you must be strong!

00:42.751 --> 00:44.544
[midwife] You must not lose
your consciousness.

00:44.627 --> 00:45.754
[midwife] Be strong!

00:45.837 --> 00:47.255
[Do-hwa breathing heavily]

00:47.338 --> 00:49.799
[wincing in pain]

00:51.176 --> 00:53.219
[somber music playing]

00:56.306 --> 00:57.140
I HAVE GONE TO BE WITH DO-HWA.

00:57.223 --> 00:58.349
WHEN SHE BEARS A CHILD,
KNOWING THAT IT IS MINE.

00:58.433 --> 00:59.768
[Seong] And here I go,

01:01.019 --> 01:04.272
having spent
seven blissful days in your body.

01:06.066 --> 01:07.150
[Seong sighs]

01:09.235 --> 01:10.612
Do-hwa will…

01:11.946 --> 01:13.990
soon give birth to my son.

01:16.409 --> 01:17.452
Your Majesty.

01:18.244 --> 01:21.956
Remember the prophecy I received
the day of my coronation?

01:22.624 --> 01:26.044
[Seong] You said
that I was to be granted a son

01:26.920 --> 01:29.964
who had the energy of the King's Star.

01:30.548 --> 01:34.219
The prophecy was incorrect.
It simply cannot be true.

01:36.763 --> 01:37.722
It is.

01:39.516 --> 01:42.060
Everything you said must be true.

01:43.061 --> 01:46.189
[Seong] I will have a son
thanks to your Alchemy of Souls.

01:48.066 --> 01:49.275
Mark my words.

01:51.152 --> 01:53.071
The child Do-hwa bears…

01:54.781 --> 01:56.074
will be my son.

01:56.157 --> 01:59.285
[intense music playing]

01:59.369 --> 02:00.453
My son.

02:03.873 --> 02:04.916
[Do-hwa breathing shakily]

02:11.965 --> 02:13.007
[Do-hwa groaning in pain]

02:15.802 --> 02:17.303
[Do-hwa grunts]

02:21.432 --> 02:23.309
[breathing shakily]

02:34.863 --> 02:36.322
[intense stinger playing]

02:43.872 --> 02:45.915
[epic music playing]

02:58.678 --> 03:00.555
[Seong] The star in the center
of the Big Dipper

03:00.638 --> 03:02.557
containing nature's secrets

03:02.640 --> 03:07.854
only reveals itself when the sky is filled
with the energy of Daeho's waters.

03:09.439 --> 03:12.025
[star chiming]

03:15.194 --> 03:18.114
And my son will be born under that star.

03:24.829 --> 03:26.623
[Jang Uk breathing heavily]

03:28.666 --> 03:31.961
As of this moment, Jang Uk
is forbidden from Songrim.

03:34.213 --> 03:36.090
As for the last one,
you should do it yourself.

03:38.593 --> 03:41.512
[melancholy music playing]

03:52.148 --> 03:52.982
[maid Kim] Mu-deok.

03:54.484 --> 03:57.695
Is it true?
The Young Master isn't talking?

03:58.821 --> 04:02.700
Yes. His back was flogged,
but it's his mouth that has been closed.

04:02.784 --> 04:05.119
That boy cries when he stubs his toe.

04:05.203 --> 04:07.413
But he's silent
after being flogged 100 times.

04:08.206 --> 04:09.123
That worries me.

04:09.207 --> 04:12.293
It must not be so terrible, otherwise,
he would be crying about it.

04:13.795 --> 04:17.757
Understand what hurts him the most
is not his back. His heart is in pain.

04:19.467 --> 04:22.720
He was cast away by the one man
he thought of like a father figure.

04:22.804 --> 04:24.430
Imagine how that must feel.

04:25.765 --> 04:27.183
Like he has been abandoned.

04:45.243 --> 04:46.286
[huffs]

04:51.666 --> 04:53.459
It's better that you've been flogged.

04:54.168 --> 04:56.754
They won't be able to retrieve
the torrent of energy yet.

04:57.505 --> 04:59.132
[Mu-deok] You bought us time to train.

05:10.435 --> 05:11.394
Young Master.

05:12.478 --> 05:13.313
Are you all right?

05:22.697 --> 05:23.906
[Jang Uk sighs]

05:28.661 --> 05:30.830
[water sloshing]

05:33.541 --> 05:35.835
Hey Mu-- Mu-deok, take a look at this.

05:35.918 --> 05:37.962
I think my energy is making these ripples.

05:43.051 --> 05:44.302
The water is just rippling.

05:46.429 --> 05:48.222
Why isn't it working?
I have been practicing.

05:49.057 --> 05:51.309
Is that what you have been doing
in silence?

05:51.392 --> 05:54.604
I thought you were moping
over being abandoned by them.

05:55.188 --> 05:57.273
- I guess not.
- [Jang Uk] Moping?

05:57.356 --> 05:59.609
I was abandoned
from the very moment I was born.

05:59.692 --> 06:01.944
And it's not like
I haven't been kicked out before.

06:02.028 --> 06:03.029
It doesn't faze me.

06:03.946 --> 06:04.947
[intense stinger plays]

06:09.035 --> 06:10.453
Just wait and see.

06:10.536 --> 06:14.040
One of these days they're going
to be begging me to come back to Songrim.

06:14.123 --> 06:15.458
[scoffs]

06:15.541 --> 06:17.126
I guess it helps that you're full of it.

06:17.794 --> 06:18.711
Of spirit.

06:22.340 --> 06:25.009
By the way, why is it so hot in here?

06:25.635 --> 06:27.261
So hot? I'm cold.

06:30.348 --> 06:32.058
Why is the water so hot?

06:34.477 --> 06:35.686
You're burning up right now.

06:37.021 --> 06:40.233
Mu-deok, I'm getting strange.
I'm getting hotter.

06:40.775 --> 06:42.026
Energy's surging.

06:43.319 --> 06:44.445
But it's so soon for that.

06:47.406 --> 06:48.574
Because of the flogging.

06:49.158 --> 06:51.160
The flogging caused
the energy to surge faster.

06:51.911 --> 06:53.371
Good thing you were flogged, Jang Uk.

06:54.789 --> 06:55.790
[Jang Uk grunts]

06:56.582 --> 06:58.251
Mu-deok, I'm burning up right now.

06:58.334 --> 07:01.587
When the torrent of energy becomes heat,
you get hot like burning coal.

07:01.671 --> 07:03.881
Next, it'll transform
to an ice-cold chill.

07:03.965 --> 07:06.592
If you bear all that,
the energy will finally become yours.

07:07.844 --> 07:10.138
Slowly. Keep breathing, okay?

07:14.475 --> 07:16.561
[thrilling music playing]

07:18.396 --> 07:19.522
Cold water.

07:20.314 --> 07:22.442
[gasps, breathes heavily]

07:33.661 --> 07:34.537
Mu-deok.

07:35.455 --> 07:37.039
Is the Young Master still bathing?

07:37.123 --> 07:39.083
It's been almost an hour since he went in.

07:39.667 --> 07:41.711
[Mu-deok] If she finds out,
she'll tell Songrim.

07:42.295 --> 07:43.880
They'll take the torrent of energy.

07:43.963 --> 07:44.839
Medicine.

07:46.382 --> 07:48.634
He's bathing in water
with herbal medicine.

07:49.469 --> 07:50.928
I put herbal medicine in the water

07:51.512 --> 07:53.848
and let him bathe in it
in order to treat his wounds.

07:55.099 --> 07:55.933
Really?

07:57.310 --> 07:58.561
Good thinking.

08:00.188 --> 08:01.564
[relieved sigh]

08:01.647 --> 08:02.482
Hold on.

08:03.733 --> 08:05.735
[tense music playing]

08:09.989 --> 08:11.741
Then why are you bringing him cold water?

08:12.325 --> 08:13.284
What?

08:13.367 --> 08:15.828
If he's been bathing for an hour,
the water must be cold.

08:16.412 --> 08:17.997
So why would you bring cold water?

08:20.791 --> 08:22.168
He has a fever?

08:23.586 --> 08:25.087
[gasps]
Young Master.

08:27.298 --> 08:28.174
[in quiet voice]
Damn.

08:30.635 --> 08:31.469
[maid Kim] It's cold.

08:32.178 --> 08:33.763
Feel how cold this water is?

08:33.846 --> 08:35.306
Do you want him to catch a cold?

08:42.146 --> 08:44.607
[Mu-deok] The boiling hot water
has become ice-cold.

08:44.690 --> 08:46.150
[maid Kim] Young Master.

08:47.944 --> 08:48.861
Where is he?

08:49.946 --> 08:50.863
[gasps]
Goodness.

08:54.825 --> 08:57.286
[hesitates]
Young Master, are you all right?

08:57.995 --> 08:59.205
[Jang Uk] Yes.

08:59.288 --> 09:02.542
Bathing in the herbal medicine
has made me drowsy.

09:05.336 --> 09:07.713
[maid Kim] What are you doing?
Hurry up and make his bed.

09:09.173 --> 09:12.468
[Mu-deok] It's the chill.
The chill has begun to surge.

09:15.596 --> 09:17.974
[Jang Uk quivering]

09:18.683 --> 09:21.769
I'm freezing. It feels like I'm in ice.

09:22.603 --> 09:26.399
It's the chill surging this time.
It's happening way faster than I thought.

09:27.817 --> 09:28.818
Keep breathing, okay?

09:30.319 --> 09:31.737
[quivering]

09:33.155 --> 09:35.866
[soft music playing]

09:54.510 --> 09:55.970
I am so cold. I think I might faint.

09:58.347 --> 10:00.266
Fight it. You must fight it.

10:00.349 --> 10:01.809
[quivering]

10:02.643 --> 10:04.186
Jang Uk!

10:04.270 --> 10:05.187
[Mu-deok] Stay with me.

10:05.271 --> 10:07.815
You will freeze to death
if you fall asleep now. Get up.

10:10.818 --> 10:12.069
Just keep breathing.

10:23.122 --> 10:26.459
Uncle, Yul and I are
the only friends that Uk has.

10:26.542 --> 10:29.128
He has nowhere else but Songrim
to call home.

10:29.211 --> 10:32.256
Please rescind your order
forbidding him to enter.

10:32.340 --> 10:33.716
He won't be able to train.

10:34.216 --> 10:36.052
Once it's known that he was banished,

10:36.135 --> 10:37.887
no one from Songrim will take him in.

10:40.056 --> 10:41.349
Enough talk of Uk.

10:41.849 --> 10:45.186
I want you two to focus
on the Soul Shifter case.

10:53.069 --> 10:54.028
[Dang-gu gasps]

10:54.111 --> 10:56.155
He has completely hardened.

10:57.448 --> 10:58.824
[Jin] He has been petrified.

10:59.742 --> 11:01.077
[gasping]

11:02.370 --> 11:03.788
[Jin] A Soul Shifter running wild

11:04.372 --> 11:06.832
replaces their lost energy
by taking a human's.

11:09.251 --> 11:10.878
He's like an evil spirit.

11:11.379 --> 11:14.006
I can see why you forbid
the Alchemy of Souls.

11:14.090 --> 11:16.967
This was not always forbidden sorcery.

11:17.551 --> 11:18.427
You can only perform it

11:18.511 --> 11:22.681
once you've mastered Jipsu, Ryusu,
Chisu, and Hwansu.

11:22.765 --> 11:24.266
[Dang-gu] Hwansu is godlike power,

11:24.350 --> 11:27.770
changing water to fire
and fire to stone as well.

11:27.853 --> 11:30.064
- I thought no one could achieve that.
- [Heo Yeom] Hmm.

11:30.147 --> 11:32.983
Master Seogyeong, founder of Songrim, did.

11:33.067 --> 11:34.568
And there was someone else as well.

11:34.652 --> 11:35.694
Who's that?

11:35.778 --> 11:37.696
Like you would know, even if I told you!

11:39.156 --> 11:41.742
Who dared to perform the Alchemy of Souls

11:41.826 --> 11:44.578
on this poor pupil?
Who did this to him?

11:44.662 --> 11:47.957
This man was meant to work at Cheonbugwan,
recording constellations.

11:48.457 --> 11:50.709
He had been visiting the place
regularly for the past few months.

11:51.710 --> 11:54.213
[Heo Yeom]
Ah! Like they caught Naksu's men,

11:54.296 --> 11:56.715
the ones we failed to catch,
as if they'd been waiting.

11:56.799 --> 11:58.050
I got it!
[claps]

11:58.134 --> 12:00.302
I bet Cheonbugwan definitely
has something to do

12:00.386 --> 12:01.429
with the Soul Shifter case.

12:03.472 --> 12:06.183
Yul, Dang-gu, keep an eye on Cheonbugwan.

12:06.267 --> 12:08.102
See if there's anything strange.
Understand?

12:08.936 --> 12:10.146
[both] Sir.

12:10.229 --> 12:12.064
[walls rumbling]

12:12.148 --> 12:12.982
What's wrong?

12:13.649 --> 12:16.026
[Sang-ho] It does that quite often
since Uk broke it.

12:17.069 --> 12:18.737
- Jang Uk, this--
- [Sang-ho] Do not move!

12:19.864 --> 12:20.698
It'll crumble.

12:24.660 --> 12:25.744
Do not move,

12:26.412 --> 12:28.122
until the door shuts completely!

12:29.123 --> 12:30.541
Jang Uk!

12:30.624 --> 12:32.626
- [all gasp]
- [Dang-gu] I told you not to move!

12:32.710 --> 12:35.129
- [Dang-gu grunts]
- [Heo Yeom] Damn you! I told you!

12:35.212 --> 12:37.298
[gasping]

12:37.381 --> 12:39.341
Calm down. You.

12:39.884 --> 12:40.926
Jang Uk!

12:41.010 --> 12:42.386
[gasping]

12:47.725 --> 12:49.268
[birds chirping]

12:54.607 --> 12:56.692
[water whooshes]

13:00.196 --> 13:01.155
[swords swish]

13:01.238 --> 13:03.240
[action music playing]

13:03.324 --> 13:05.201
- [swords clanging]
- [women grunting]

13:12.249 --> 13:13.918
[Master Lee] Stay down for a moment.

13:15.377 --> 13:17.213
[ominous music playing]

13:33.020 --> 13:33.979
Sapsali.

13:34.980 --> 13:35.981
Come on out.

13:36.857 --> 13:38.442
You are now coming with me.

13:49.370 --> 13:50.538
[loud rumble]

14:23.070 --> 14:24.738
You have done very well, my friend.

14:24.822 --> 14:25.948
[dog barks]

14:28.701 --> 14:32.538
If you find the Soul Shifters,
I'll reward you with treats.

14:33.289 --> 14:34.373
I hope we get along.

14:35.749 --> 14:36.917
[growls]

15:04.737 --> 15:05.613
Mu-deok.

15:07.823 --> 15:09.116
If I freeze to death,

15:11.035 --> 15:12.536
take the torrent of energy…

15:14.997 --> 15:16.832
from within me if you can.

15:18.208 --> 15:20.669
If I could do that,
I would already have killed you.

15:24.173 --> 15:25.591
I'm freezing to death here…

15:27.176 --> 15:29.303
please don't say such cold things now.

15:31.347 --> 15:32.765
Say something heartwarming.

15:33.349 --> 15:35.517
Have you gone mad from the energy surging?

15:35.601 --> 15:36.810
What's with you?

15:41.649 --> 15:43.734
Jang Uk! Wake up.

15:44.443 --> 15:47.446
All right, fine then.
I'll say something warm.

15:50.282 --> 15:53.744
There was a huge tree
back where I used to live.

15:54.370 --> 15:55.746
[soft music playing]

15:55.829 --> 15:59.208
And there was a bird's nest
right up at the top of it.

15:59.291 --> 16:00.960
The egg inside, it was warm.

16:02.711 --> 16:03.712
Did you eat it?

16:04.922 --> 16:06.590
I said this would be heartwarming.

16:08.509 --> 16:10.511
[soft music continues playing]

16:12.388 --> 16:14.890
The mother bird used to always come by
to sit on it.

16:19.520 --> 16:20.562
Right now, I am…

16:21.397 --> 16:23.857
the egg in that bird's nest
at the top of the tree.

16:27.361 --> 16:28.654
I know no one.

16:30.948 --> 16:32.491
And I cannot know anything.

16:36.829 --> 16:39.248
You're the only person
who can take care of me.

16:43.460 --> 16:44.628
And right now…

16:45.921 --> 16:47.756
I'm holding on to that one person.

16:55.264 --> 16:56.515
How heartwarming.

17:02.980 --> 17:04.189
Please keep going.

17:08.527 --> 17:11.405
There was also a small cave
nearby where I used to live.

17:13.782 --> 17:15.659
And there was a bear cub inside.

17:19.788 --> 17:21.290
[low, indistinct chatter]

17:47.316 --> 17:49.276
How can you expect
to learn how to cast any spells,

17:49.359 --> 17:51.278
when you can't even unsheathe
your father's sword?

17:53.030 --> 17:55.532
There is no mage in Daeho
that would go against your father

17:55.616 --> 17:57.701
and dare to open
your gate of energy for you.

17:57.785 --> 18:00.496
That is the fate that your father…

18:01.497 --> 18:03.165
has determined for you.

18:04.833 --> 18:07.002
[brooding music playing]

18:15.928 --> 18:17.262
[Jang Uk grunting]

18:24.520 --> 18:25.687
You're not ready just yet.

18:25.771 --> 18:27.397
[breathes shakily]

18:31.902 --> 18:34.446
To unsheathe a sword
imbued with the energy of a mage,

18:35.072 --> 18:38.158
you must master Ryusu and be able
to channel your energy outward.

18:38.867 --> 18:41.078
Since you cannot yet surge
the energy within,

18:41.161 --> 18:42.246
you can't unsheathe it.

18:42.913 --> 18:45.791
This is the sword
my so-called father left behind.

18:45.874 --> 18:48.085
I can only join Songrim
if I'm able to unsheathe it.

18:50.921 --> 18:52.840
I want to unsheathe it and show them all.

18:54.216 --> 18:55.050
Am I full of it?

18:55.551 --> 18:56.844
Of spirit.

18:59.096 --> 19:01.974
Carry it with you, Jang Uk.

19:02.057 --> 19:04.643
[harmonious music playing]

19:04.726 --> 19:05.894
[laughs softly]

19:21.201 --> 19:23.620
Your Highness, we've arrived
at the house of Jang Gang,

19:23.704 --> 19:24.705
Gwanju of Cheobugwan.

19:29.126 --> 19:30.169
Young Master!

19:32.296 --> 19:34.673
[maid Kim] There is-- Forgive me,
but you have a guest.

19:35.382 --> 19:36.300
Who is it?

19:36.383 --> 19:39.636
It's the Crown Prince. He's come
from the Royal Palace to see you.

19:41.513 --> 19:44.183
[suspenseful music playing]

20:00.324 --> 20:01.992
[Dang-gu exclaims]

20:02.075 --> 20:04.578
[Dang-gu] This is the perfect weather

20:04.661 --> 20:08.081
to go fishing with Uk
at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

20:09.416 --> 20:10.250
[sighs]

20:10.334 --> 20:12.878
I wonder if he's recovered
from the flogging.

20:14.463 --> 20:16.632
I'm going to see him
because I'm quite worried right now.

20:17.216 --> 20:18.383
But why are you tagging along?

20:18.467 --> 20:19.801
[whimsical music playing]

20:19.885 --> 20:21.178
To check something.

20:21.261 --> 20:23.305
There is something I said to his servant.

20:23.388 --> 20:26.475
Hmm. Well, that… I understand.

20:26.558 --> 20:28.685
We're his good friends.
But why are you tagging along?

20:29.811 --> 20:31.939
I just happened to run into you.

20:32.022 --> 20:34.483
And I happened to have
a bone to pick with him.

20:34.566 --> 20:35.692
So that's why I'm going.

20:35.776 --> 20:38.237
Ah, so you're going to fight with him.

20:38.904 --> 20:40.447
What do you have in that bundle?

20:42.074 --> 20:43.242
[chuckles nonchalantly]

20:43.825 --> 20:45.410
Medicine for his wounds.

20:46.036 --> 20:49.831
Oh, you're going to fight with him,
and then give him medicine.

20:50.999 --> 20:53.418
- [Dang-gu] I see. Incredible.
- [sighs]

20:55.379 --> 20:57.547
So, you've come for Naksu's sword,
Your Highness?

20:57.631 --> 20:59.466
The King's entrusted it to Cheonbugwan.

21:00.133 --> 21:03.303
The Gwanju is gone, so Assistant Gwanju,
Jin Mu should take it.

21:07.432 --> 21:10.394
Since you have come here yourself,
I shall return it.

21:10.477 --> 21:11.478
You may take it back.

21:11.561 --> 21:12.938
[Jang Uk] Bring it here.

21:14.815 --> 21:15.649
[Go Won] One more thing.

21:16.608 --> 21:18.986
There's another sword here
which you cannot unsheathe.

21:20.654 --> 21:24.157
The late king Seon bestowed it
on the Gwanju of Cheonbugwan, Jang Gang.

21:24.866 --> 21:26.285
I will take that one as well.

21:26.368 --> 21:29.413
That sword belongs
to Young Master's father, Your Highness.

21:30.038 --> 21:31.665
It's only right that his son keeps it.

21:31.748 --> 21:33.292
It was never given to him to begin with.

21:34.668 --> 21:36.878
I heard it was being kept in Songrim.

21:36.962 --> 21:39.881
And you only took it
after you were banished, did you not?

21:41.591 --> 21:45.012
The Royal Palace will keep it
until a new Gwanju has been instated.

21:47.014 --> 21:48.056
Bring me the sword.

21:48.140 --> 21:50.600
[tense music playing]

21:55.480 --> 21:56.898
I cannot do that, Your Highness.

21:59.109 --> 22:02.362
As you already know,
no one acknowledges him as my father.

22:04.031 --> 22:06.450
It'll not bode well for me
to lose the sword as well.

22:07.659 --> 22:10.245
Even merely as decoration, I'll keep it.

22:11.330 --> 22:12.289
[chuckles]

22:13.874 --> 22:15.834
I must take it with me when I leave.

22:16.668 --> 22:18.879
Since you refuse, I have no other choice.

22:21.381 --> 22:22.966
Whoever wins shall take it.

22:26.720 --> 22:29.389
[dramatic music playing]

22:41.026 --> 22:42.819
It's not fair to challenge you
to a real fight

22:42.903 --> 22:44.237
when you're not fully trained.

22:50.535 --> 22:52.621
So, if you can push me over this line,

22:53.288 --> 22:54.581
I will leave you the sword.

23:07.177 --> 23:08.804
[thrilling music playing]

23:09.387 --> 23:12.641
I'm sure, Your Highness,
that you have been expecting me

23:12.724 --> 23:13.934
to grovel in humiliation.

23:15.268 --> 23:18.605
I would have to be full of it to think
that I can compete with you right now.

23:18.688 --> 23:21.399
However, some would call that spirit,

23:21.483 --> 23:22.442
so I'll try my best.

23:30.617 --> 23:32.619
[action music playing]

23:42.838 --> 23:44.381
[heels screeching]

23:45.966 --> 23:47.217
[gasps]

23:48.802 --> 23:50.095
[wooden swords clacking]

23:51.930 --> 23:52.889
[Jang Uk groans]

24:01.940 --> 24:02.816
[grunts in pain]

24:15.829 --> 24:17.164
[Mu-deok] Energy's surging.

24:17.247 --> 24:18.540
Because of the flogging.

24:18.623 --> 24:20.667
The flogging caused
the energy to surge faster.

24:21.543 --> 24:23.128
Good thing you were flogged, Jang Uk.

24:23.211 --> 24:26.089
[Jang Uk] All right.
Show me what you've got.

24:36.141 --> 24:37.350
[groans]

24:53.658 --> 24:55.327
[dramatic music playing]

25:16.681 --> 25:17.807
[Jang Uk groans]

25:39.996 --> 25:42.040
[dramatic music intensifies]

25:46.169 --> 25:47.295
[Mu-deok] Watch out!

25:47.921 --> 25:49.047
This is from the chamber pots!

26:02.560 --> 26:03.603
What's the meaning of this?

26:05.021 --> 26:05.897
Who is she?

26:07.232 --> 26:10.151
- I'm the Young Master's servant.
- How dare a servant intervene?

26:13.863 --> 26:15.282
My apologies, Your Highness.

26:15.365 --> 26:17.033
My servant was being insolent.

26:19.703 --> 26:20.537
[Go Won] What is this?

26:23.331 --> 26:25.792
- [sniffs]
- Argh! Get it off me!

26:25.875 --> 26:27.294
You should return and get changed.

26:28.295 --> 26:30.547
- What?
- You stepped over the line you drew.

26:34.134 --> 26:36.553
[Jang Uk] You may have stepped back
to avoid the filthy water.

26:36.636 --> 26:38.805
But it is still your loss,
Your Royal Highness.

26:39.306 --> 26:41.266
Please go, and leave
Jang Gang's sword behind.

26:42.267 --> 26:43.810
As you can see,

26:43.893 --> 26:46.438
I'm injured, so I'm afraid
I will not be able to see you out.

26:50.525 --> 26:51.484
Oh.

26:54.154 --> 26:55.363
What's going on?

26:56.448 --> 26:57.657
[Go Won] All right.

26:57.741 --> 26:59.576
I will keep my promise
and let you have it.

27:00.285 --> 27:01.286
[Go Won] However…

27:02.454 --> 27:03.913
you know the girl must be punished.

27:09.377 --> 27:11.713
A servant must not dirty
the clothes of a Crown Prince.

27:23.183 --> 27:24.726
[tense music playing]

27:31.524 --> 27:32.400
[swords clang]

27:36.738 --> 27:38.031
[clanging echoes]

27:40.533 --> 27:42.786
[suspenseful music playing]

27:43.370 --> 27:44.371
[gasps]

27:46.206 --> 27:47.540
[grunts]

27:50.085 --> 27:52.003
[swords swish, clang]

28:00.595 --> 28:02.013
[sword chiming]

28:04.599 --> 28:07.143
I-I unsheathed this sword.

28:21.199 --> 28:22.033
Jang Uk!

28:23.535 --> 28:25.203
I thought your gate of energy was blocked,

28:25.745 --> 28:27.414
but you have been deceiving us all.

28:30.542 --> 28:31.459
[Jang Uk] What's this?

28:39.134 --> 28:39.968
[eunuch] You!

28:40.969 --> 28:43.012
How dare you point
a sword at the Crown Prince?

28:43.096 --> 28:44.681
- No, it's not me--
- Uk! Drop it!

28:45.682 --> 28:47.892
- Put the sword down!
- [Jang Uk] I'm trying to!

28:48.476 --> 28:50.478
I swear, but I can't!
[groans]

28:50.562 --> 28:51.813
[Jang Uk groans]

28:51.896 --> 28:53.064
[gasps]

28:56.860 --> 28:57.736
[exclaiming]

29:12.876 --> 29:14.002
Stop it! What are you doing?

29:15.837 --> 29:17.172
I told you I'm not--
[yelps]

29:29.642 --> 29:30.560
Jang Uk.

29:31.644 --> 29:32.896
Die!

29:36.399 --> 29:37.400
[loud clang]

29:42.781 --> 29:43.823
Please stop this.

29:49.829 --> 29:50.914
Oh.

29:52.415 --> 29:54.292
- Stop this!
- I can't control my arm.

29:55.835 --> 29:57.670
[grunts, groans]

29:57.754 --> 29:59.130
I-I didn't mean that!

29:59.631 --> 30:02.050
[maid Kim] Young Master, Young Master,
Young-- Ah!

30:02.884 --> 30:04.469
- [maid Kim shouts]
- [Jang Uk grunts]

30:04.552 --> 30:05.553
[bracelet jingling]

30:09.015 --> 30:10.934
It's a binding bracelet,
over a hundred geun,

30:11.017 --> 30:12.685
your arm won't be able to move.

30:15.063 --> 30:16.231
[maid Kim gasps]

30:18.691 --> 30:20.360
[Mu-deok] His energy
couldn't surge properly.

30:20.443 --> 30:22.737
It overflowed into one arm
and he lost control.

30:24.447 --> 30:25.615
Unbind him now!

30:28.159 --> 30:29.118
Jang Uk.

30:30.203 --> 30:31.412
Take up your sword.

30:33.623 --> 30:34.582
[Seo Yul] Your Highness.

30:34.666 --> 30:36.668
Please, Jang Uk is no match
for your skills.

30:36.751 --> 30:37.836
Did you not see it?

30:38.419 --> 30:40.964
[Go Won] He unsheathed his father's sword
and pointed it at me.

30:41.047 --> 30:43.508
Uk could not control his energy.
It's just him making a mistake.

30:43.591 --> 30:46.177
- As you saw, he even hit me as well--
- Stay out of it!

30:48.179 --> 30:50.765
Your Highness, it was you
who drew your sword first.

30:51.349 --> 30:53.393
If the sword you wielded
in anger was broken,

30:53.476 --> 30:55.895
you should abide by the customs
and return home.

30:58.106 --> 30:58.940
[scoffs]

30:59.023 --> 31:01.901
So you all dare stand
against the Crown Prince.

31:04.404 --> 31:07.532
[Go Won] Jang, Park, Jin, and Seo.
All four families.

31:08.950 --> 31:11.578
I refuse to return defeated like this.

31:11.661 --> 31:12.745
What will you do?

31:14.080 --> 31:16.666
Fight together,
all four families against me?

31:23.840 --> 31:26.509
- [whimsical music playing]
- [Dang-gu] Uh, this looks bad.

31:27.093 --> 31:29.596
All four families
against the Royal family.

31:30.179 --> 31:31.598
This is getting pretty serious.

31:31.681 --> 31:33.266
Cho-yeon provoked him too much.

31:33.349 --> 31:34.934
Me? What did I do?

31:35.560 --> 31:38.396
Fine, just hand Uk over.

31:38.479 --> 31:39.480
Your Highness,

31:40.440 --> 31:42.692
they are the heirs
of the four great families of Daeho.

31:43.276 --> 31:44.736
If His Majesty hears of this,

31:44.819 --> 31:45.987
he will be furious.

31:48.156 --> 31:50.158
Well, what should I do?
Just leave like this?

31:51.534 --> 31:53.077
Why didn't you stop me earlier?

31:54.120 --> 31:56.122
[whimsical music continues playing]

32:07.759 --> 32:08.635
Mu-deok, you…

32:17.101 --> 32:18.770
I've committed a crime worthy of death.

32:20.146 --> 32:23.316
This lowly servant
dared to splash filthy chamber pot water

32:23.399 --> 32:24.484
on His Royal Highness.

32:29.572 --> 32:31.950
[Mu-deok] I'm sorry.
It's a crime worthy of death.

32:32.033 --> 32:33.159
[Go Won groans]
Get away!

32:33.826 --> 32:35.536
Go. You reek. Go!

32:36.663 --> 32:38.915
Please, please forgive me.

32:42.669 --> 32:48.508
As a token of my apology,
I will drink the rest of this water.

32:48.591 --> 32:50.718
[Mu-deok] So please, forgive me.

33:00.770 --> 33:01.646
Mu-deok!

33:03.982 --> 33:06.109
Why on earth would you drink that, huh?

33:08.987 --> 33:09.821
Young Master!

33:13.241 --> 33:14.867
I should be the one drinking it.

33:16.494 --> 33:17.829
What?

33:19.706 --> 33:21.207
Uh, no.

33:21.290 --> 33:23.126
Why would you drink it, Young Master?

33:23.209 --> 33:25.628
I'm the cause of all this,
so I should drink it.

33:25.712 --> 33:28.965
No, it's because of me
that His Royal Highness is angry.

33:29.048 --> 33:30.758
So I ought to drink it.

33:34.387 --> 33:36.389
But, there's quite a bit.

33:37.223 --> 33:39.892
So, just give it to me then,
and I'll drink it.

33:39.976 --> 33:41.102
How about we each drink half?

33:42.437 --> 33:44.647
Why would we share this water
like it's something good?

33:44.731 --> 33:45.648
Huh?

33:46.649 --> 33:47.817
Here, you can have it.

33:48.818 --> 33:51.446
[retches] I'll drink
as much as I can and leave you the rest.

33:52.196 --> 33:54.323
I can't use my arm with these beads
so help me hold it.

33:57.410 --> 33:59.162
- [breathes in deeply]
- Young Master!

34:04.000 --> 34:06.502
I will drink! I will--
[retches]

34:06.586 --> 34:08.046
- [stifled gag]
- Huh?

34:08.629 --> 34:09.589
It's fine.

34:09.672 --> 34:11.549
Why should you have to drink this?
Just go!

34:11.632 --> 34:12.759
[whimsical music playing]

34:13.426 --> 34:15.094
[Dang-gu] Just how much is there?

34:15.178 --> 34:16.721
I should drink some, too, huh?

34:17.430 --> 34:19.307
- [Jang Uk] Really?
- [Dang-gu] Yeah, give it to me.

34:20.600 --> 34:23.311
[retching]

34:23.394 --> 34:25.313
It really is--
[groans]

34:25.813 --> 34:27.940
[Cho-yeon coughs]

34:28.024 --> 34:29.067
[Seo Yul] Your Highness.

34:29.150 --> 34:31.152
How could we have the audacity
to challenge you?

34:32.278 --> 34:35.615
Must they really drink
that chamber pot water as an apology?

34:38.993 --> 34:39.869
[groans]

34:41.496 --> 34:44.707
Just forget it.
I can't watch this anymore.

34:47.168 --> 34:48.252
Let's go.

34:50.088 --> 34:53.299
[eunuch] His Royal Highness is leaving!
Bow before him!

34:59.180 --> 35:01.557
But, why was the Crown Prince here
in the first place?

35:02.266 --> 35:04.227
He came to get Naksu's sword.

35:04.852 --> 35:06.854
And he suddenly picked a fight
with Young Master.

35:07.522 --> 35:10.274
I mean, he may have just left for today,
but with that temper,

35:10.775 --> 35:12.068
there's more trouble ahead.

35:16.030 --> 35:18.407
- [Dang-gu] Are you all right?
- [Jang Uk] He hit me so many times.

35:18.491 --> 35:19.784
[Jang Uk groans]

35:19.867 --> 35:21.494
[Dang-gu] Hey,
you hurt me back there, too.

35:23.454 --> 35:25.164
- [maid Kim] Are you all right?
- [Jang Uk] Yeah, I'm fine.

35:25.248 --> 35:27.166
- [wincing in pain]
- Oh, it hurts right there?

35:27.250 --> 35:29.001
[Jang Uk] It hurts. Why would you…

35:29.085 --> 35:30.586
[maid Kim] Stop that, Young Master?

35:33.714 --> 35:36.008
Your Highness! Your Highness!

35:41.013 --> 35:42.431
What's this?

35:42.515 --> 35:45.518
You said you came here for Naksu's sword,
and so I brought it to you.

35:47.562 --> 35:48.396
Right.

35:49.313 --> 35:50.857
I did come to retrieve that.

35:50.940 --> 35:54.694
I brought it because someone as important
as you shouldn't have to come back for it.

35:54.777 --> 35:56.154
Please take it.

35:56.988 --> 36:00.283
So, what you'd like me to do
is to take it and never return?

36:00.867 --> 36:05.580
Mm, Your Royal Highness
is so very intelligent and strong.

36:05.663 --> 36:07.874
You're teasing me
because I lost to your master?

36:07.957 --> 36:10.793
You lost? Your Highness is taking
what you came here for.

36:11.377 --> 36:12.879
My Young Master is losing it to you.

36:12.962 --> 36:15.965
It seems, instead,
that you are the winner here.

36:16.048 --> 36:18.301
[playful music playing]

36:18.384 --> 36:22.054
The young lady is correct.
Your Royal Highness has won.

36:22.889 --> 36:25.266
[in sing-song tone]
Congratulations.

36:27.351 --> 36:28.477
Let's say it's true.

36:31.939 --> 36:34.692
Ah! You are truly so generous as well.

36:34.775 --> 36:37.653
There is no other man
who is as noble as you.

36:42.533 --> 36:43.367
What is your name?

36:45.661 --> 36:47.121
Mu-deok, Your Highness.

36:48.372 --> 36:49.207
Mu-deok.

36:50.291 --> 36:53.336
Since you threw filth at me,
I'll call you Filthy Mu-deok.

36:54.086 --> 36:57.965
Just like your name,
you reek of filth right now.

36:58.049 --> 36:59.383
[laughs awkwardly]

37:04.347 --> 37:06.349
You even gave me a nickname.

37:06.432 --> 37:10.061
I, Filthy Mu-deok, forever am grateful
for your kindness.

37:14.315 --> 37:15.691
Goodbye, Your Highness.

37:17.860 --> 37:18.736
Let's go.

37:27.828 --> 37:30.498
[Mu-deok] My pupil is still too weak
to fight you.

37:31.332 --> 37:34.669
Until he is ready,
I cannot let him be at odds with you.

37:42.218 --> 37:44.679
You don't hesitate to fall in love
or grovel

37:45.179 --> 37:46.472
for your master's sake.

37:46.555 --> 37:49.058
I am too weak to fight him myself,
so I did what I could.

37:51.143 --> 37:54.021
And now I reek of filth.
You should avoid me too.

38:00.111 --> 38:00.945
Here.

38:04.907 --> 38:07.285
How could I possibly dirty
the man I'm in love with?

38:08.286 --> 38:09.370
No, thank you.

38:44.780 --> 38:47.533
Ugh, I really am Filthy Mu-deok.

38:53.497 --> 38:56.375
[Mu-deok] You should wash yourself.
You probably reek too.

38:59.879 --> 39:02.256
[soft music playing]

39:14.101 --> 39:16.437
Master, I finally did it.

39:22.193 --> 39:23.235
[laughs softly]

39:42.755 --> 39:46.592
The Gwigu that was stored
at Jinyowon has been stolen recently.

39:48.052 --> 39:51.806
No one outside of the Jin family
can open the door to Jinyowon.

39:52.765 --> 39:55.768
They must have summoned the Gwigu
to get it out of there.

39:57.478 --> 39:58.896
A burglary at Jinyowon?

39:59.480 --> 40:02.733
I suppose since the devastation
of losing your eldest daughter,

40:02.817 --> 40:05.611
your energy must not be the same
as it was before.

40:06.654 --> 40:08.948
You impudent bastard.

40:09.532 --> 40:12.993
You may be illegitimate,
but you're still part of the Jin family.

40:13.077 --> 40:15.162
How dare you speak
to your sister like that?

40:15.246 --> 40:16.372
How dare you?

40:16.455 --> 40:17.748
I'm the Assistant Gwanju now

40:17.832 --> 40:20.459
and I'd appreciate it
if you showed me more respect.

40:20.543 --> 40:21.710
[Heo Yeom sighs]

40:28.467 --> 40:31.679
My Lord, please come outside.
Jang Uk is here.

40:37.768 --> 40:38.727
[sighs]

40:53.117 --> 40:55.119
[Jin] I have forbidden Jang Uk
from entering.

40:55.202 --> 40:58.747
So why are you all here,
marching in behind him now?

40:59.832 --> 41:01.459
There is something I wish to show you.

41:08.757 --> 41:10.551
This is the sword of my father.

41:11.343 --> 41:12.470
[Jang Uk] When I was a child,

41:12.553 --> 41:14.722
you said if I could unsheathe it,
you would accept me.

41:15.473 --> 41:16.348
Do you remember?

41:28.986 --> 41:30.029
[energy chimes]

41:37.995 --> 41:40.915
[dramatic music playing]

41:57.306 --> 42:00.017
I thought his gate of energy
had just opened recently.

42:00.643 --> 42:04.313
He-- he has absorbed my torrent of energy!
[laughs]

42:04.396 --> 42:06.065
[Ho-gyeong] Like father, like son.

42:07.066 --> 42:08.692
He mastered Ryusu at once.

42:09.652 --> 42:12.571
My Lord, please accept me now

42:13.405 --> 42:14.406
into Songrim.

42:19.328 --> 42:20.871
What is that thing around your arm?

42:21.455 --> 42:23.707
His energy is focused in his right arm.

42:24.208 --> 42:27.127
He can't control it yet,
so it's tied with a binding bracelet.

42:39.223 --> 42:40.683
Remove the binding bracelet.

42:41.600 --> 42:43.811
If we remove it now,
his arm will be out of control.

42:44.311 --> 42:47.064
He needs to receive some more training
before he can remove it safely.

42:48.274 --> 42:49.233
Remove it now.

43:09.795 --> 43:11.171
[energy chiming]

43:15.801 --> 43:19.054
Let me see how well you hold that sword.

43:27.104 --> 43:29.023
[Jang Uk grunts]

43:29.106 --> 43:30.608
[tense music playing]

43:37.489 --> 43:38.574
[grunting]

43:50.544 --> 43:51.670
Put the bracelet on.

44:05.517 --> 44:07.895
Are you-- are you all right?

44:08.854 --> 44:10.773
What's the point of unsheathing the sword…

44:12.941 --> 44:14.485
when you cannot even wield it?

44:20.491 --> 44:22.660
[Cho-yeon] He is unable
to control it for now.

44:22.743 --> 44:24.411
But Jang Uk's power is incredible.

44:24.995 --> 44:26.497
He even defeated the Crown Prince.

44:27.206 --> 44:29.917
Jang Uk broke
His Royal Highness's sword in one stroke.

44:30.000 --> 44:32.544
Even the Prince
who mastered Ryusu long ago

44:32.628 --> 44:33.754
lost to him.

44:35.631 --> 44:37.925
Jin Cho-yeon, stop intervening.

44:39.176 --> 44:40.469
Yes, Mother.

44:41.595 --> 44:46.100
Uk, did you take up arms
against the Crown Prince?

44:46.684 --> 44:48.435
Uk was not the first to start the fight.

44:48.519 --> 44:50.396
Did you fight against the Crown Prince?

44:52.606 --> 44:53.440
Yes.

44:54.817 --> 44:57.444
His Royal Highness wanted
to take the Gwanju's sword.

44:57.528 --> 44:59.488
So the two of them made a bet, my Lord.

45:00.114 --> 45:02.074
[maid Kim] Even the Crown Prince
forgave him.

45:03.283 --> 45:04.660
After breaking the Prince's sword,

45:04.743 --> 45:06.745
Uk threatened him
with a sword he can't control.

45:07.788 --> 45:10.582
He chose to put
the Crown Prince's life in danger.

45:10.666 --> 45:11.667
We were all there with him.

45:12.793 --> 45:13.877
We were able to stop him.

45:13.961 --> 45:15.921
Meaning that the four of you
simply watched

45:16.004 --> 45:18.257
and did nothing
as His Royal Highness was ridiculed.

45:20.634 --> 45:23.720
This is an insult to the royal family!

45:26.807 --> 45:28.517
Lock up Jang Uk.

45:31.395 --> 45:33.564
He's a dangerous man
with a sword he can't control at all.

45:33.647 --> 45:34.773
[Sang-ho] Yes, my lord.

45:35.315 --> 45:37.484
[dramatic music playing]

45:54.376 --> 45:56.253
As soon as his gate of energy was opened,

45:56.336 --> 46:00.174
Jang Uk immediately drew his sword
at the Crown Prince.

46:03.510 --> 46:06.013
Cheonbugwan is not going
to take this lightly.

46:06.096 --> 46:07.806
[melancholy music playing]

47:06.156 --> 47:07.783
Why haven't you received
any treatment yet?

47:07.866 --> 47:09.284
You bled a lot back there.

47:11.328 --> 47:13.205
Your arm, is it all right?

47:17.501 --> 47:19.711
The weight of the bracelet
makes it difficult to move it.

47:20.546 --> 47:21.630
But I'm all right for now.

47:23.298 --> 47:26.468
You managed to make Master Heo's
torrent of energy yours

47:26.552 --> 47:28.053
in a short period of time.

47:29.388 --> 47:30.430
I'm very impressed.

47:33.308 --> 47:34.977
It felt like my body was on fire.

47:35.644 --> 47:38.105
But then after that,
it felt like I was covered in ice.

47:39.940 --> 47:41.275
And your flogging wounds?

47:42.109 --> 47:43.110
Are they all right?

47:46.363 --> 47:50.409
It seems that the flogging
helped the energy to surge much faster.

47:52.369 --> 47:54.413
The Prince beat me quite a bit too.

47:55.706 --> 47:59.585
- Mm.
- Then I felt a surge within myself, so…

47:59.668 --> 48:00.961
I unsheathed the sword.

48:03.422 --> 48:04.339
Right.

48:05.257 --> 48:09.595
You always were a quick learner
compared to the other children.

48:10.762 --> 48:14.266
[Jin] You even learned
to walk and run sooner than Dang-gu did.

48:15.392 --> 48:17.603
You were even talking earlier.

48:19.021 --> 48:20.522
Yes, I remember that as well.

48:21.148 --> 48:24.693
So, when I was young, before I knew
what a blocked gate of energy was,

48:26.486 --> 48:28.655
I thought I'd be
the most powerful person in the world.

48:28.739 --> 48:31.199
[soft music playing]

48:34.286 --> 48:35.120
Uk.

48:36.997 --> 48:40.375
Since you are so intelligent,
and such a quick learner…

48:43.378 --> 48:47.591
Why don't you join our trade at Songrim?
You could learn how to do business here.

48:48.175 --> 48:52.929
Or you could learn the art of medicine
under Master Heo.

48:57.976 --> 48:59.102
I can't.

49:01.980 --> 49:04.983
I am going to train at Jeongjingak
and become a powerful mage.

49:05.651 --> 49:06.526
Why?

49:07.861 --> 49:10.405
Because you have to do the same thing
that your father did?

49:12.491 --> 49:15.494
Do you want to become
the next Gwanju of Cheonbugwan after him?

49:16.244 --> 49:18.914
Yes. And I will be.

49:20.248 --> 49:21.708
I'll take his place,

49:21.792 --> 49:24.836
and I'll prove myself
to all the scumbags who say…

49:26.254 --> 49:27.339
that I'm not his son.

49:27.422 --> 49:28.256
[Jin] You…

49:30.634 --> 49:31.885
will never be…

49:33.387 --> 49:34.304
his son.

49:37.724 --> 49:38.934
You are…

49:40.060 --> 49:42.854
the child of an affair
had by your mother Do-hwa.

49:44.356 --> 49:45.190
[breathes shakily]

49:45.691 --> 49:48.735
[Jin] You're allowed into the Jang family
out of respect for your late mother,

49:48.819 --> 49:51.196
but we cannot allow you
to lead Cheonbugwan after your father.

49:51.279 --> 49:54.199
So you can stop dreaming
because you'll never become anything…

49:57.536 --> 49:58.412
like your father.

50:00.122 --> 50:02.457
Just continue to remain the Young Master…

50:04.000 --> 50:06.253
of the Jang family
who doesn't know anything.

50:08.338 --> 50:09.214
If you do…

50:11.550 --> 50:13.218
we can continue to take care of you.

50:13.301 --> 50:15.971
[melancholy music playing]

50:20.976 --> 50:21.810
Wait.

50:25.397 --> 50:26.857
Who is my real father, then?

50:29.735 --> 50:33.405
How could anyone know
who your late mother…

50:36.324 --> 50:37.826
had an affair with?

50:39.786 --> 50:40.871
[Jang Uk breathes shakily]

50:40.954 --> 50:42.414
[somber music playing]

51:12.402 --> 51:14.529
Uk must have a lot on his mind right now.

51:14.613 --> 51:16.156
You should let him be.

51:22.871 --> 51:24.748
Make sure he still finishes his food.

51:34.549 --> 51:37.135
Maid Kim told me to make sure
you finished your whole meal.

51:41.181 --> 51:42.390
Did he scold you?

51:44.893 --> 51:47.020
I thought you were used to
being scolded by the…

51:51.024 --> 51:52.734
[pensive music playing]

51:54.402 --> 51:56.071
[doors rumbling]

51:59.783 --> 52:00.867
I did not do that.

52:01.451 --> 52:04.329
I think they have yet to fix the door
that you broke last time.

52:06.957 --> 52:07.874
Do not move.

52:09.668 --> 52:10.919
Just stay there.

52:14.923 --> 52:16.716
Everything could crumble, so…

52:19.469 --> 52:20.720
just stay there.

52:30.188 --> 52:31.022
[sniffles]

52:34.025 --> 52:36.194
Why did you not even attempt
to avoid his blade?

52:37.737 --> 52:41.741
Was it so you could have a reason
to banish him again?

52:42.868 --> 52:44.369
It was the least I could do.

52:44.953 --> 52:48.456
After all, I was the one
who just broke his heart.

52:50.208 --> 52:54.212
Having to break his heart
must be more painful than being stabbed.

52:56.256 --> 52:57.215
Maid Kim.

52:58.049 --> 53:00.218
You said before that

53:00.969 --> 53:03.597
there were rumors
about me being Uk's father.

53:03.680 --> 53:05.515
Well, what if I were to say that

53:06.266 --> 53:10.353
that I was indeed his father to everyone?

53:14.232 --> 53:16.234
I'd step down from my position, and…

53:18.069 --> 53:20.238
I would open up
a little business of my own.

53:21.781 --> 53:23.658
Then I could go about trading with Uk.

53:24.242 --> 53:26.912
What about Songrim?
What would they do without you?

53:29.039 --> 53:30.498
It would be even better

53:31.583 --> 53:33.627
if I were to say he was my child.

53:34.336 --> 53:35.545
Then Uk and I

53:35.629 --> 53:39.007
could just go and live in the small town
where I grew up with Lady Do-hwa.

53:40.675 --> 53:41.509
[chuckles]

53:41.593 --> 53:44.304
Now that is impossible.

53:45.013 --> 53:45.847
Hmm?

53:46.431 --> 53:48.558
You know Uk takes after Do-hwa.

53:49.351 --> 53:50.435
That's why…

53:51.645 --> 53:53.438
he's so good-looking.

53:54.940 --> 53:56.066
Who would believe…

53:56.149 --> 53:57.317
[chuckles]

53:58.526 --> 54:00.028
…that you were the mother of Jang Uk?

54:02.238 --> 54:03.239
Wait a minute.

54:04.032 --> 54:07.869
You're saying, if he were to resemble me,
he would be ugly?

54:09.079 --> 54:11.247
Then, you can't say
you are his father, either.

54:11.331 --> 54:12.832
Of course, I can.

54:13.500 --> 54:16.044
Jang Gang and I
have always been neck and neck…

54:17.879 --> 54:20.382
[playful music playing]

54:20.465 --> 54:22.550
…when it came to our looks.

54:24.844 --> 54:26.972
[chuckles in disbelief]
No, you lost.

54:27.555 --> 54:29.099
You can't hold a candle to him.

54:29.182 --> 54:33.228
Do-hwa said she loved everything
about you except for your looks.

54:33.311 --> 54:34.980
Stop it! You're just making that up!

54:35.563 --> 54:36.690
[groans]

54:36.773 --> 54:38.525
You didn't flinch when you got stabbed,

54:38.608 --> 54:40.568
but I guess
hearing you're ugly hurts more.

54:41.069 --> 54:42.237
My wound…

54:44.030 --> 54:45.448
it actually does hurt.

54:45.949 --> 54:47.867
- Oh, dear. Does it really hurt?
- [wincing]

54:47.951 --> 54:50.328
Oh, stay still.
You're going to reopen your wound.

54:50.412 --> 54:51.579
[groans]

54:52.372 --> 54:53.415
We share…

54:55.709 --> 54:57.752
the exact same kind of pain…

54:59.754 --> 55:01.548
not having our feelings reciprocated

55:02.507 --> 55:04.843
by the ones we loved the most.

55:05.427 --> 55:06.261
So…

55:07.762 --> 55:09.014
let's not hurt each other.

55:11.057 --> 55:14.394
All right, I admit that I made that up.

55:14.477 --> 55:15.770
You are…

55:16.980 --> 55:18.982
[stutters]
…good…

55:20.692 --> 55:22.861
[stutters]
…good…

55:24.529 --> 55:26.031
You are good-looking.

55:28.491 --> 55:31.202
And you are also indeed…

55:31.286 --> 55:32.454
[stutters]

55:36.332 --> 55:38.918
…good-looking.

55:47.093 --> 55:49.888
Let me continue tending to your wound.

55:50.555 --> 55:51.598
It really hurts.

55:52.974 --> 55:54.142
- [maid Kim blows]
- [groans]

55:55.351 --> 55:56.853
A-a bit lower.

55:57.437 --> 55:59.230
Yep. Yeah--
[groans]

56:01.066 --> 56:02.025
Goodness.

56:04.360 --> 56:06.988
[ominous music playing]

56:10.116 --> 56:11.534
The Spirit Plaque from Chwiseonru

56:11.618 --> 56:13.620
belongs to Jang Uk of the Jang family.

56:15.038 --> 56:15.914
Jang Uk?

56:15.997 --> 56:18.792
He was flogged recently
for losing Songrim's Spirit Plaque.

56:18.875 --> 56:22.629
And I hear that his servant would be seen
at Chwiseonru quite frequently.

56:25.590 --> 56:28.426
[Gil-ju] That girl we saw at Songrim
is his servant.

56:29.677 --> 56:31.805
And she was at the inn that day.

56:35.225 --> 56:36.226
Could she be…

56:37.393 --> 56:38.478
Naksu?

56:42.524 --> 56:45.610
[in strained voice]
How much further to Cheonbugwan?

56:49.030 --> 56:52.575
It won't be long until I'm petrified.

56:53.326 --> 56:54.994
We will hurry. Please hold on.

56:55.703 --> 56:57.539
You must not run wild right now.

56:58.748 --> 57:01.000
[servant] My Lord, are you all right?

57:01.084 --> 57:04.337
[sinister stinger playing]

57:07.173 --> 57:09.425
[servant gasping]

57:29.070 --> 57:31.531
[in normal voice]
Let us return.

57:37.370 --> 57:40.248
[dramatic music playing]

57:52.302 --> 57:56.806
In that short period of time,
even if it was only one arm,

57:56.890 --> 57:59.851
you reached Ryusu, huh?
[laughs]

58:00.768 --> 58:03.980
[Heo Yeom] You truly are the son
of the incredible Jang Gang.

58:04.063 --> 58:05.857
[laughing]

58:06.357 --> 58:08.318
Jin Mu of Cheonbugwan

58:08.401 --> 58:09.819
only picked a fight because he knew

58:09.903 --> 58:11.696
that he would never become
the next Gwanju.

58:12.489 --> 58:14.115
[Dang-gu] He realized that you,

58:14.199 --> 58:17.660
the eldest son of the Jang family,
will become the next Gwanju, you know.

58:26.211 --> 58:28.338
My uncle's wound is not that deep.

58:29.255 --> 58:30.715
Nothing to worry about.

58:30.798 --> 58:35.303
About Jin Mu, don't worry,
I will have a word with him, all right?

58:35.803 --> 58:37.263
[sighs]

58:39.307 --> 58:42.936
- Hmm. All right, all right.
- Please take good care of him.

58:58.284 --> 58:59.244
[sighs]

59:11.381 --> 59:13.341
You always put Uk in danger.

59:15.009 --> 59:17.595
First the poison, and then
the incident with the Prince.

59:18.346 --> 59:19.597
You're always involved.

59:21.808 --> 59:25.395
So, are you saying that
you would like to separate me from him?

59:25.478 --> 59:26.688
No, I cannot do that.

59:30.024 --> 59:32.151
Because every time that
he got what he wanted,

59:33.111 --> 59:34.654
you risked your life to help him.

59:41.494 --> 59:43.204
This is Uk's father's sword.

59:43.788 --> 59:44.998
Take it with you.

01:00:13.526 --> 01:00:15.403
I'm not gonna tolerate this.

01:00:15.486 --> 01:00:17.238
How much longer
are you going to be this way?

01:00:19.782 --> 01:00:20.825
[sighs]

01:00:24.203 --> 01:00:25.163
[Mu-deok] Get up!

01:00:37.842 --> 01:00:40.845
You received a powerful torrent of energy
and managed to surge it.

01:00:41.512 --> 01:00:45.391
It took you merely ten days
when it would have taken others ten years.

01:00:45.475 --> 01:00:46.976
If you continue your training--

01:00:47.060 --> 01:00:48.686
[shouts]
Leave me alone, okay?

01:00:50.730 --> 01:00:51.898
[Mu-deok scoffs]

01:00:51.981 --> 01:00:53.691
Is this because
of something Park Jin said?

01:00:54.359 --> 01:00:56.527
[Mu-deok] What you said
about spirit was just talk.

01:00:56.611 --> 01:00:58.404
How can you be this pathetic
to be discouraged

01:00:58.488 --> 01:00:59.489
by just a few stupid words?

01:00:59.572 --> 01:01:02.617
Of course I'm discouraged
that I'm not going to do this anymore.

01:01:02.700 --> 01:01:03.910
So, just shut up, damn it!

01:01:06.037 --> 01:01:07.330
Don't bother me.

01:01:15.088 --> 01:01:17.382
I have no need for a pupil
who won't do anything.

01:01:21.803 --> 01:01:23.221
Then don't be my master.

01:01:24.514 --> 01:01:25.848
Just be my servant.

01:01:27.183 --> 01:01:28.851
I'll sell you if you annoy me.

01:01:30.770 --> 01:01:32.772
[somber music playing]

01:02:08.015 --> 01:02:08.891
Young Master.

01:02:11.436 --> 01:02:16.065
My Young Master is so troubled
that he will not even drink water.

01:02:16.149 --> 01:02:18.109
Young Master Dang-gu, please help me.

01:02:18.192 --> 01:02:19.694
But what can I do, though?

01:02:20.445 --> 01:02:22.280
It's better to just wait
until my uncle resolves this.

01:02:22.363 --> 01:02:25.032
No, but Master Heo said
that he would resolve this.

01:02:25.783 --> 01:02:29.412
Please ask him to meet with Jin Mu
immediately and put an end to this.

01:02:29.495 --> 01:02:30.496
[sighs]

01:02:34.083 --> 01:02:37.670
[Heo Yeom] I came here today
because I am somewhat concerned

01:02:37.754 --> 01:02:41.340
that you may have made
a mountain out of a molehill.

01:02:41.424 --> 01:02:43.593
Tell me, how could a threat
to the Crown Prince,

01:02:43.676 --> 01:02:45.803
the future king, be deemed trivial?

01:02:48.347 --> 01:02:52.059
That is why our leader decided
to lock Jang Uk away.

01:02:52.143 --> 01:02:54.896
Songrim will give him
the punishment he needs.

01:02:54.979 --> 01:02:57.732
You realize it is a crime
against the royal family.

01:02:58.441 --> 01:03:01.402
Cheonbugwan is in charge
of matters related to the royal family,

01:03:01.486 --> 01:03:02.945
so we'll deal with him here.

01:03:03.029 --> 01:03:05.156
But what will you do with him here?

01:03:05.239 --> 01:03:07.158
Since he threatened the life
of the Crown Prince,

01:03:07.825 --> 01:03:09.076
he should be beheaded.

01:03:09.160 --> 01:03:10.620
[Heo Yeom splutters]

01:03:11.204 --> 01:03:15.082
However, we cannot kill
the one and only son of the Gwanju.

01:03:16.000 --> 01:03:17.710
So instead, we ought to amputate the arm

01:03:17.794 --> 01:03:19.670
with which he tried to threaten
the Crown Prince.

01:03:20.338 --> 01:03:21.672
[Heo Yeom] Amputate his arm?

01:03:22.256 --> 01:03:23.883
Your pride must be hurt right now,

01:03:23.966 --> 01:03:26.219
because your pupil, the Prince,
lost to Uk,

01:03:26.302 --> 01:03:29.013
whose gate of energy
has been open for not even ten days!

01:03:29.096 --> 01:03:31.891
You fool, I was going
to be nice about this,

01:03:31.974 --> 01:03:34.227
let it slide out of consideration
for you and the Prince.

01:03:34.310 --> 01:03:35.937
But you've gone completely insane!

01:03:36.020 --> 01:03:39.774
Let Cheonbugwan decide whether it's me
or Jang Uk's arm that's insane.

01:03:39.857 --> 01:03:42.902
- That's it!
- Oh, oh, oh, M-Master, please.

01:03:44.737 --> 01:03:47.323
Both the Prince and Uk agreed
to fight each other.

01:03:47.907 --> 01:03:50.201
We have brought Uk's servant
who witnessed everything.

01:03:50.993 --> 01:03:51.869
Come here.

01:03:53.246 --> 01:03:54.705
It was a fair fight.

01:03:56.165 --> 01:04:00.920
But if you cannot believe us,
why not just let them fight once again?

01:04:01.879 --> 01:04:04.215
[tense music playing]

01:04:05.091 --> 01:04:08.761
Let them fight again?
That's not a bad idea.

01:04:10.179 --> 01:04:12.014
Since you claim he wasn't threatening
the Prince

01:04:12.098 --> 01:04:14.600
and that it was a fair fight
between mages,

01:04:15.810 --> 01:04:18.771
why don't we have an official duel
between the Crown Prince and Jang Uk?

01:04:18.855 --> 01:04:21.691
[stutters]
Duel between Uk and the Prince?

01:04:22.275 --> 01:04:25.486
If you can't agree to that,
hand Uk over to Cheonbugwan.

01:04:25.570 --> 01:04:27.613
But if you accept this, then,

01:04:28.197 --> 01:04:31.158
even if one of them dies,
no one will be held responsible

01:04:32.201 --> 01:04:33.911
as per the customs of Daeho.

01:04:35.079 --> 01:04:35.955
Uh…

01:04:45.590 --> 01:04:48.217
[Dang-gu] We came here to resolve it,
but we only made things worse.

01:04:48.801 --> 01:04:52.972
I let that sly snake
somehow get the better of me.

01:04:53.055 --> 01:04:55.308
Uk will die if he duels
against the Crown Prince.

01:04:55.391 --> 01:04:57.351
- What do we do?
- Do not worry.

01:04:57.435 --> 01:04:59.854
The Crown Prince
will not accept the challenge.

01:05:00.855 --> 01:05:03.482
Ever since Master Seogyeong
founded Songrim,

01:05:03.566 --> 01:05:06.861
there has never been a duel
between the royal family and the mages.

01:05:06.944 --> 01:05:08.529
Both sides have respected

01:05:08.613 --> 01:05:09.989
a kind of unwritten rule

01:05:10.072 --> 01:05:13.492
to keep them from wasting their energy
on each other.

01:05:14.076 --> 01:05:15.161
There is no way

01:05:15.244 --> 01:05:18.623
the Crown Prince would break that rule
just to fight against Uk.

01:05:19.206 --> 01:05:20.333
[hums in agreement]

01:05:27.632 --> 01:05:29.842
[Jin Mu]
Accept the challenge, Your Highness.

01:05:30.426 --> 01:05:32.720
[Go Won]
I don't see why I should be at odds

01:05:32.803 --> 01:05:34.722
with Songrim over that fool.

01:05:34.805 --> 01:05:38.809
We're lucky to have a favorable scenario
that they cannot blame us for.

01:05:38.893 --> 01:05:42.271
You can prove exactly how strong you are
to everyone in Songrim,

01:05:42.355 --> 01:05:43.189
Your Royal Highness.

01:06:03.834 --> 01:06:05.419
[Seo Yul] They're from Cheonbugwan
and the palace.

01:06:06.003 --> 01:06:06.963
What's going on?

01:06:07.880 --> 01:06:09.799
Argh, seriously, though, Master Heo Yeom.

01:06:10.591 --> 01:06:12.551
He was so certain
that nothing would happen to him.

01:06:12.635 --> 01:06:13.803
[Dang-gu] What is this?

01:06:15.262 --> 01:06:16.347
What will happen to Uk now?

01:06:19.684 --> 01:06:22.561
I don't understand what's going on.
Why are they all here right now?

01:06:22.645 --> 01:06:25.815
I was actually here
to talk to you about that.

01:06:26.399 --> 01:06:28.526
But it looks like Jin Mu beat me to it.

01:06:28.609 --> 01:06:29.860
[Heo Yeom breathes heavily]

01:06:29.944 --> 01:06:31.112
Jin Mu, you say?

01:06:31.904 --> 01:06:34.240
Did something happen again?

01:06:34.907 --> 01:06:35.992
[splutters]

01:06:36.075 --> 01:06:37.576
Ugh, damn it!

01:06:37.660 --> 01:06:39.495
[eunuch] His Royal Highness,
the Crown Prince,

01:06:39.578 --> 01:06:41.831
has challenged Jang Uk to a duel.

01:06:44.500 --> 01:06:46.627
The Assistant Gwanju has instructed it

01:06:46.711 --> 01:06:48.462
that Jang Uk be brought to Cheonbugwan,

01:06:48.546 --> 01:06:50.965
if he refuses to participate in the duel.

01:06:51.549 --> 01:06:54.468
Jang Uk is already locked up
in the prison of Songrim.

01:06:56.387 --> 01:06:59.807
And you want to transfer him?
What is this about?

01:06:59.890 --> 01:07:01.600
Please ask Master Heo.

01:07:02.309 --> 01:07:05.688
I was told
they had already come to an agreement.

01:07:05.771 --> 01:07:06.689
[sighing]

01:07:11.110 --> 01:07:13.863
[suspenseful music playing]

01:07:14.655 --> 01:07:17.366
Uk, get up. You need to get out of here.

01:07:18.034 --> 01:07:19.285
[sighs]
Why?

01:07:19.368 --> 01:07:22.747
No time to explain. If you don't leave
right now, you'll… lose your arm.

01:07:23.664 --> 01:07:25.416
Or you might even be killed.

01:07:26.000 --> 01:07:27.293
- What?
- Young Master.

01:07:27.877 --> 01:07:29.420
Things have gotten serious.

01:07:29.503 --> 01:07:31.922
If you continue just lying in here,
you could lose your life.

01:07:33.132 --> 01:07:34.508
Will you still do nothing?

01:07:40.681 --> 01:07:41.932
[Heo Yeom sighs]

01:07:45.853 --> 01:07:47.980
[Jin] I will go with Jang Uk
to the royal palace

01:07:48.647 --> 01:07:50.399
to meet with the Crown Prince.

01:07:50.983 --> 01:07:52.943
They will bring Uk soon,
so just wait here.

01:07:57.615 --> 01:07:58.491
Where is he?

01:07:58.574 --> 01:08:01.827
He's not in the secret room.
He must have escaped somehow.

01:08:02.453 --> 01:08:03.537
What?

01:08:10.127 --> 01:08:13.172
[laughs]
When you have no better option,

01:08:13.255 --> 01:08:16.634
fleeing may be your best bet.
[laughs]

01:08:17.676 --> 01:08:18.636
Uh…

01:08:23.265 --> 01:08:26.102
He was here all along,
and only his servant came and went.

01:08:26.685 --> 01:08:28.270
[Sang-ho] I don't understand how he fled.

01:08:31.065 --> 01:08:32.775
Where are Yul and Dang-gu right now?

01:08:41.617 --> 01:08:45.246
[Seo Yul] Our leader will handle it.
Lie low until the dust settles.

01:08:46.497 --> 01:08:49.250
Mu-deok, please take good care of him.

01:08:50.167 --> 01:08:53.170
Are you sure you really don't need us
to come with you?

01:08:53.254 --> 01:08:55.840
Yes. We are going to the place
I used to live.

01:08:55.923 --> 01:08:57.800
I heard Sari Village, was it?

01:08:57.883 --> 01:09:00.803
Stay there, then, and we will come
to get you as soon as we can.

01:09:06.809 --> 01:09:09.019
You've managed
to put him in danger once again.

01:09:12.439 --> 01:09:14.567
Then he'll get what he wants once more.

01:09:17.111 --> 01:09:19.738
[harmonious music playing]

01:09:38.757 --> 01:09:40.301
[tense music playing]

01:09:40.384 --> 01:09:42.011
[Sun sighs]

01:09:42.094 --> 01:09:46.891
[Sun] This duel will take place
the middle of next month.

01:09:46.974 --> 01:09:49.101
[Sun] That will be the end of it.

01:09:51.979 --> 01:09:55.900
Then, if Jang Uk
does not appear on that day…

01:09:57.985 --> 01:09:59.820
please accept that as his defeat.

01:09:59.904 --> 01:10:02.364
[Jin Mu] That is just fleeing, not losing.

01:10:04.533 --> 01:10:07.119
There should be consequences
for such a cowardly defeat.

01:10:09.705 --> 01:10:11.332
Jin Mu speaks the truth.

01:10:11.916 --> 01:10:14.752
If Jang Uk does not appear
at the dueling ground,

01:10:14.835 --> 01:10:17.046
he will be deprived of his right to become

01:10:18.255 --> 01:10:19.173
the next Gwanju.

01:10:27.264 --> 01:10:29.266
I understand, Sire.

01:10:44.073 --> 01:10:45.241
[Jang Uk sighs]

01:10:47.034 --> 01:10:48.744
Why bring that when we're fleeing?

01:10:50.287 --> 01:10:51.789
Because you need this to train.

01:10:51.872 --> 01:10:54.458
Train? I thought we were just trying
to run away?

01:10:56.043 --> 01:10:58.545
- Were you behind all this?
- Yeah, I merely played a part.

01:10:59.046 --> 01:11:01.966
You had to hear you might lose your life
before you'd finally move.

01:11:02.049 --> 01:11:03.050
[huffs]

01:11:04.051 --> 01:11:05.302
What?

01:11:05.386 --> 01:11:07.388
I have no need for a pupil
who won't improve.

01:11:08.430 --> 01:11:10.849
If you're not going to do anything,
you should just die.

01:11:11.433 --> 01:11:12.851
So you've poisoned me again,

01:11:13.852 --> 01:11:15.646
my crazy master.

01:11:16.313 --> 01:11:17.273
Jang Uk.

01:11:18.148 --> 01:11:20.401
We're going to the place
where I used to train.

01:11:20.484 --> 01:11:21.652
You should brace yourself now.

01:11:22.152 --> 01:11:25.281
Where we're going,
there will be no more warm baths for you.

01:11:25.781 --> 01:11:27.324
There will be no cozy beds,

01:11:28.242 --> 01:11:30.286
none of that delicious food
you love so much.

01:11:32.454 --> 01:11:35.416
Is Sari Village really that scary?

01:11:36.333 --> 01:11:38.877
Sari Village
was where Mu-deok used to live.

01:11:38.961 --> 01:11:40.838
Where Naksu is from…

01:11:42.006 --> 01:11:43.382
is Danhyanggok.

01:11:45.759 --> 01:11:47.386
And that is where we are heading now.

01:11:47.469 --> 01:11:50.389
["Scars Leave Beautiful Trace"
by Car, the Garden playing]

01:12:43.942 --> 01:12:45.736
[Mu-deok] Why are all these things
around here?

01:12:45.819 --> 01:12:46.945
Mu-deok. Wow.

01:12:47.029 --> 01:12:49.365
I thought for a second you were using
training as an excuse

01:12:49.448 --> 01:12:51.700
to kidnap your Young Master
and settle down with him.

01:12:51.784 --> 01:12:54.828
[Mu-deok] I have so much to teach you,
lots and lots of things.

01:12:54.912 --> 01:12:57.623
You just described
the most dangerous kind of woman!

01:12:57.706 --> 01:12:59.208
[Seo Yul]
I don't enjoy sweet things, either.

01:12:59.291 --> 01:13:01.502
If you do not wish to eat,
then just leave.

01:13:01.585 --> 01:13:02.961
Mu-deok's making breakfast with Yul.

01:13:03.045 --> 01:13:04.922
Oh goodness, I told you…

01:13:05.005 --> 01:13:07.132
Yes, yes, I am angry.
How dare you teach some other guy

01:13:07.216 --> 01:13:08.926
when you have a pupil
who is alive and well?

01:13:09.009 --> 01:13:11.637
[mage] How about we strip Jang Uk
of his rights to be a mage?

01:13:12.179 --> 01:13:15.057
Jang Uk has no one to teach him.

01:13:15.140 --> 01:13:17.434
[Master Lee] There's a great soul
who shifted into this body.

01:13:18.394 --> 01:13:19.436
Mu-deok, run!

01:13:19.520 --> 01:13:20.896
[Jang Uk] I didn't want to do anything…

01:13:20.979 --> 01:13:22.314
But she's the last thing stopping me.
